{"ts":"2026-08-31T12:01:18.293Z","author":"claude-orchestrator","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"c41a528b9f424137989cc889","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-slack-m43u"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A Slack Retry-After header can park the process for weeks, because the delay we control is clamped and the delay a server controls is not"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"CodeQL flagged js/resource-exhaustion at index.ts line 1176 on the first scan this repository has ever had: a timer is created with a user-controlled duration. Traced to slackRetryDelayMs, which returns a server-supplied retryAfterMs verbatim while clamping its own exponential fallback to 8000 milliseconds. The bound is therefore applied to the value we compute and withheld from the value a remote supplies, which is exactly backwards. parseRetryAfterMs accepts any non-negative integer of seconds or any future HTTP-date, so a response carrying a Retry-After of 99999999 makes the process sleep for roughly eleven days on a single header. Slack real rate-limit windows are seconds to a couple of minutes, so a two minute ceiling never truncates a legitimate wait. This alert existed only because a CodeQL workflow was added to this repository today; before that nothing was looking, and a repository with no scanner is indistinguishable from one with no findings."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-31T12:01:18.293Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T12:01:18.293Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-orchestrator"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"628fd30fa2e38fc48eeb49f7ea14d374f3787e9e65625b5d255b0b0f444e7915","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
